+## Changed
+
+- Copied every golden except `print-goldens.mjs.txt` into `crates/features/approve/tests/fixtures/approve-worktree/`, unchanged.
+- `approve` now loads `osq.toml` before reading a change, and with git on approves into the change's own `osq/<folder>` branch and worktree; with git off it still writes the checkout marker.
+- Added the worktree orchestration: branch creation at the base commit, worktree add, `vcs.prepare`, rollback on prepare failure, recursive copy of the checkout's change folder, `.run/approved`, `.run/base`, `.run/approver`, the approval commit, the `worktree-add`, `worktree-prune` and `commit` tree records, stacked-copy removal, and checkout-draft removal.
+- Added `osq-kernel-config`, `osq-kernel-harnesses` and `osq-kernel-vcs` to the approve crate.
+- Added `tests/approve_worktree.rs` and `tests/worktree_support/mod.rs`, with one test for each of the five named scenarios plus one proving the worktree copy replaces the committed copy.
+
+## Deviated
+
+- Added `worktree_copy_replaces_the_committed_copy` after the mutation check reported the `copy::remove` line missed: it commits an extra file in the worktree's copy and checks that approval removes it.
+- `Cargo.lock` changed automatically when Cargo registered the three new workspace dependencies. No task scopes it; the proposal allows the lock to follow a manifest in scope.
+
